  login wall / empty shell. Launch the full Chromium in new headless mode (channel 'chromium',
  BROWSER_CHANNEL, automatic fallback), plain Chrome UA matching the installed major version
  (BROWSER_USER_AGENT override), fixed timezone/locale and navigator.webdriver hidden.
- Cookies forwarded by the OrbitPress app were injected without 'expires' (never written to the
  persistent profile) and never replaced a stale stored session. sanitizeForwardedCookies now
  gives them a 30-day expiry, validates domains, and a fresh c_user+xs login clears the old one.
- JOB_TIMEOUT_MS default 90 s -> 180 s; requests may pass timeoutSeconds (capped by
  JOB_TIMEOUT_MAX_MS, 600 s) to match the app's 300 s read timeout.

Diagnostics: describeFacebookOutcome classifies empty pages as login_wall / session_rejected /
checkpoint / unavailable / unsupported_browser / no_posts with loginRequired and an actionable
warning; responses add cookiesForwarded, sessionForwarded, sessionAccepted, browserChannel,
userAgent, jobTimeoutMs; /health exposes version + browser config; session import visits the
site so the profile is flushed and reports whether real login cookies were imported; Pinterest
gets a specific empty-result warning. JSON body limit 256 kB. 4 new tests (11 total).
